{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0186e1015464ac17","name":"Nebulon-B Escort Frigate","source":{"id":"source:reference-0186e1015464ac17","title":"Nebulon-B Escort Frigate","revision":18763,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:41:27Z","sha256":"e36be1b17a134d7beb91f624824846ac326253d9962ea61bf5caade026b3649b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18763","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Nebulon-B%20Escort%20Frigate&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0186e1015464ac17","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Zann Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Zann_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:939c32df8a6e4fbd"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In the earliest days of the Rebellion, the Alliance was hugely successful in its attacks against Imperial shipping and supply convoys. Much of the reason behind these successes was the Empire's reluctance to assign its valuable ",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Destroyers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Destroyers"}," to something as menial as escort duty. What the Empire required was a less expensive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," with the capacity to carry ",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Fighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Fighters"},". Well armed and able to carry two dozen ",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Fighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Fighters"},", the Nebulon-B Escort Frigate quickly stymied the majority of Alliance raids on Imperial shipping. Rebel pilots were dismayed to discover that raids on convoys, which were once considered to be veritable cakewalks, had become much more dangerous.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Despite the Empire's dominance in regards to the Nebulon-B, the Alliance has managed to acquire several of the ships for its own use. A number of these ships were captured by daring attacks on Imperial dockyards, while others were placed under Alliance control by their sympathetic captains. These Nebulon-B Escort Frigates functioned as the Alliance's primary assault ships during the early stages of the Galactic Civil War, until the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," joined the cause against the Empire.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Several of the Alliance's Nebulon-B Frigates, such as The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Redemption"]},", are modified to function as medical frigates. Up to 700 wounded can be tended aboard a single frigate, and the most technically advanced medical equipment available to used to treat them. In addition to organic doctors, these ships employ numerous Medical Droids.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Nebulon-B Frigate was incredibly well suited to a number of tasks, such as anti-",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," screening and suppression of mid-sized warships. Aside from performing escort duty, the Nebulon-B was easily adapted to other purposes. It was well suited to long-range patrols, able to go up to two years before its stores ran dry. Search and rescue duties were second nature for the Nebulon-B, and several such frigates were employed as deterrents to space pirates and smugglers. Because the Nebulon-B was equipped with sophisticated scanners and deep-space antenna arrays, it performed exceptionally well as a command center during space battles and planetary assaults.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Nebulon-B Escort Frigate Statistics (CL 16)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 14 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 37; +12 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 720; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 100; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 1